{"id": "EUVD-2026-104918", "enisaUuid": "3a3faa26-31ac-303f-bf0c-49494285f51c", "description": "OpenCATS before 0.10.0 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in ImportUI::handleRequest() that allows low-privileged authenticated users to roll back data imports. Attackers with READ-level access can request the import module's revert action with an importID to mass-delete imported candidate, company, and contact records.", "datePublished": "2026-10-20T10:41:34", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20T13:44:48", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/opencats/OpenCATS/issues/720", "https://github.com/opencats/OpenCATS/commit/aa3b414c3672f5010ca26c44192aa8e72d3735bd", "https://github.com/opencats/OpenCATS/releases/tag/v0.10.0", "https://github.com/opencats/OpenCATS/blob/5781f41814f09493c7ce05b9251b5e09c1aff0cd/modules/import/ImportUI.php#L155-L188", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/opencats-before-0.10.0-missing-authorization-via-import-revert-action"], "aliases": ["GHSA-p2pv-jqq4-q5gx", "CVE-2026-112786"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.27, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "1ee2f119-e9b7-3318-8733-2338b8378b2d", "product": {"name": "OpenCATS", "vendor": {"name": "opencats"}}, "product_version": "0 <0.10.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "7df86752-bc4f-3756-896b-536eda19a708", "vendor": {"name": "opencats"}}], "isExploited": false}